    <string name="steps_miui">1. App info → Battery saver → No restrictions\n2. Messages app → Settings → turn off \"Free network messages\"\n3. Open recent apps and pull down the SMS Hooks card to lock it\n4. App info → Permissions: set every permission to \"Always allow\" and turn off \"Blank pass\"</string>
    <string name="steps_huawei">1. Settings → Apps → App launch → SMS Hooks: turn off \"Manage automatically\", then turn on Auto-launch, Secondary launch and Run in background\n2. Messages app → Settings → turn off verification code protection\n3. Open recent apps and pull down the SMS Hooks card to lock it\n4. If the icon has a red \"!\": Phone Manager → Virus scan → App control → remove the restriction</string>
